+
+// Harness-injected <system-reminder> text inside a user turn is a system
+// instruction, not something the user said, so it must not come back as
+// role:"user" evidence (docs/recall-evidence.md). User-role fields use the
+// same isWrapperRequest predicate as the conversation reader, so evidence is
+// no stricter than conversation. entireio/entire-brain#565.
